      "name": "apply_operators",
      "filePath": "subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py",
      "lineRange": [229, 294],
      "summary": "应用多个算子进行异常检测或特征分析。区分普通异常检测算子（逐指标处理）和特征分析算子（处理整个DataFrame），返回各算子的检测结果。",
      "tags": ["算子执行", "批量处理", "异常检测"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
