      "lineRange": [1266, 1301],
      "summary": "获取可用算子分类，按统计类、机器学习类、PyOD、深度学习、特征分析五大类返回当前可用的算子列表。根据依赖库的可用性动态返回。",
      "tags": ["元数据", "算子列表", "分类"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py:_zscore_anomaly",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_zscore_anomaly",
      "filePath": "subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py",
      "lineRange": [298, 322],
      "summary": "Z-score异常检测，支持鲁棒参数估计。使用迭代鲁棒估计器（基于MAD）计算均值和标准差，对异常值不敏感。返回异常分数和异常掩码。",
      "tags": ["统计方法", "异常检测", "z-score"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py:_iqr_anomaly",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_iqr_anomaly",
      "filePath": "subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py",
      "lineRange": [324, 359],
      "summary": "IQR异常检测，基于四分位距识别异常值。支持鲁棒参数估计，计算到边界的距离作为异常分数，归一化到IQR单位。",
      "tags": ["统计方法", "异常检测", "iqr"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py:_hampel_anomaly",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_hampel_anomaly",
      "filePath": "subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py",
      "lineRange": [516, 553],
      "summary": "Hampel Filter异常检测，基于中位数绝对偏差（MAD）。使用中位数代替均值、MAD代替标准差，对异常值更鲁棒。使用1.4826系数将MAD转换为标准差单位。",
      "tags": ["统计方法", "异常检测", "鲁棒估计"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py:_isolation_forest_anomaly",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_isolation_forest_anomaly",
      "filePath": "subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py",
      "lineRange": [592, 618],
      "summary": "孤立森林异常检测，基于sklearn实现。通过随机树划分隔离异常点，返回异常分数和异常掩码。当sklearn不可用时降级到zscore。",
      "tags": ["机器学习", "异常检测", "孤立森林"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py:_vae_anomaly",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_vae_anomaly",
      "filePath": "subagents/anomaly-detection-agent/skills/anomaly-detection-core/scripts/operator_adapter.py",
      "lineRange": [928, 1053],
      "summary": "VAE（变分自编码器）异常检测，使用PyTorch实现。通过训练VAE重构正常数据，重构误差大的样本被标记为异常。当深度学习库不可用时降级到zscore。",
      "tags": ["深度学习", "异常检测", "vae", "pytorch"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
